WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.879
People hurried through the Metro City subway station.

2
00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:11.584
"Out of my way!" a man said. "I'm late for work!"

3
00:00:11.584 --> 00:00:14.922
A young woman walked into the station.

4
00:00:14.922 --> 00:00:19.115
She had a violin and a hat.

5
00:00:19.115 --> 00:00:21.855
She placed the hat on the floor.

6
00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:26.053
Then she ran her bow across the violin's strings.

7
00:00:26.053 --> 00:00:30.774
Strange music filled the air. Everyone stopped walking.

8
00:00:30.774 --> 00:00:35.497
They all turned to stare at the young woman.

9
00:00:35.497 --> 00:00:41.336
Suddenly they pulled out their wallets and tossed them into the hat!

10
00:00:41.336 --> 00:00:45.231
"I can't wait for the concert to start," Mara said.

11
00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:49.380
"It'll be so cool to hear a real orchestra!"

12
00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:52.672
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Park.

13
00:00:52.672 --> 00:00:57.121
The Metro City Symphony Orchestra was going to perform a concert.

14
00:00:57.121 --> 00:00:59.797
People sat on blankets on the grass.

15
00:00:59.797 --> 00:01:04.711
The musicians were onstage, tuning their instruments.

16
00:01:04.711 --> 00:01:08.409
"It's really warm today," Mara said.

17
00:01:08.409 --> 00:01:10.898
"Temperature affects musical instruments.

18
00:01:10.898 --> 00:01:14.181
That's why the musicians are checking them now."

19
00:01:14.181 --> 00:01:17.571
"I love live music," Terrell said.

20
00:01:17.571 --> 00:01:20.622
"I might join the school jazz band next year.

21
00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:23.571
I've been taking clarinet lessons."

22
00:01:23.571 --> 00:01:27.552
Jack shrugged. "I guess the concert will be okay.

23
00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:30.666
I don't really like classical music though.

24
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:35.572
I like rock and roll!" Jack jumped to his feet.

25
00:01:35.572 --> 00:01:38.813
He held up his hands as if he was holding a guitar.

26
00:01:38.813 --> 00:01:45.795
Everyone laughed as Jack danced around, pretending to be a rock star.

27
00:01:45.795 --> 00:01:50.278
"Well, I like classical music," Mara said.

28
00:01:50.278 --> 00:01:53.754
"The orchestra is going to play my favorite song today.

29
00:01:53.754 --> 00:01:57.521
I'm trying to learn it on the cello, but it's really hard."

30
00:01:57.521 --> 00:02:00.317
"Just keep practicing," Roxy said.

31
00:02:00.317 --> 00:02:02.620
"You'll get better and better.

32
00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:05.744
Maybe one day you'll perform here!"

33
00:02:05.744 --> 00:02:09.274
Mara laughed. "I doubt that!"

34
00:02:09.274 --> 00:02:14.164
"I know someone who's probably really good at music," Terrell said.

35
00:02:14.164 --> 00:02:16.008
Roxy rolled her eyes.

36
00:02:16.008 --> 00:02:21.148
"Ugh, Terrell. I doubt Rocket Girl even plays an instrument."

37
00:02:21.148 --> 00:02:23.046
Terrell looked surprised.

38
00:02:23.046 --> 00:02:26.411
"How did you know I was talking about Rocket Girl?"

39
00:02:26.411 --> 00:02:33.507
Roxy laughed. "Terrell, you always talk about Rocket Girl!"

40
00:02:33.507 --> 00:02:37.110
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

41
00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.980
She looked around and then back at her friends.

42
00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:41.539
"I'll be right back.

43
00:02:41.539 --> 00:02:44.964
I, um, think I saw my neighbor.

44
00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:47.945
I want to go say hi."

45
00:02:47.945 --> 00:02:51.710
Roxy ducked behind a statue and pressed a button on her watch.

46
00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.450
Mayor Bloom's face appeared on the screen.

47
00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:57.898
"What's wrong, Mayor?" Roxy asked.

48
00:02:57.898 --> 00:03:01.101
"We need your help, Rocket Girl," Mayor Bloom said.

49
00:03:01.101 --> 00:03:04.136
"Mrs. Bun was having a fancy garden party.

50
00:03:04.136 --> 00:03:07.295
All of her guests were robbed!"

51
00:03:07.295 --> 00:03:13.826
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said. "I'm on my way!"

